; ches_tile is the service-agnostic tile foundation: stable view identity, per-view
; capabilities, focus/capture and input routing, and shared list navigation. It must
; never depend on ches_error, ches_app, or any content source or producer: content
; adapters (in ches_screen) translate their domain to and from its opaque actions.
; Like ches_input it is terminal-independent.

(library
 (name ches_tile)
 (libraries ches_input core)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_jane)))
